WEBVTT

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:09.660
On how to hit balls at different distances: we simply divide them into three: close, middle and far.

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:13.518
First, close range. What is close range?

00:00:13.518 --> 00:00:19.400
A ball you can reach with a full stroke without moving your feet: a ball right by your feet.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.500 line:10%
Ball machine market

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.500 line:10%
Market leader

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:22.550
For these you usually just fine-tune and hit.

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:28.220
Adjust the distance to the ball with small steps and simply take the racket back.

00:00:28.220 --> 00:00:36.772
In practice we use pairs of balls: on the first, only practise loading with the racket back;

00:00:36.772 --> 00:00:41.420
on the second, keep that backswing rhythm and hit.

00:00:47.880 --> 00:00:53.860
Once you have that backswing rhythm, we put it into the forehand and backhand framework and practise each with the ball machine.
